feat(categories): complete health set + add chef, gas, sports training, appliance repair, pet care

- Health: add Odontología, Pediatría, Optometría (es_salud), relabel
  medicina_domicilio -> "Medicina general"; all flagged for the booking DOB step.
- New hireable services: Chef privado y cocina (eventos), Servicio de gas +
  Reparación de electrodomésticos (hogar), Entrenamiento deportivo + Cuido y
  paseo de mascotas (salud group, NOT es_salud — no DOB).
- EN labels added for every new id. Taxonomy is centralized in categories.ts, so
  the megamenu, /categorias, the /buscar filter, project + profession selectors
  and the "¿no ves tu categoría?" flow all pick them up automatically.
- Migration 052 inserts the new categories into the DB table and sets es_salud
  for the new health ones (must be applied in Supabase). category_id FK was
  already dropped (013), so existing data is unaffected.
- Home carousel left as its curated image-backed subset (new ids have no image).

